*** Install elpa-*.deb packages

They are tested with this particular ~Emacs~ version and seems to me
much appealing as a much resilient and safe to use altogether. Replace all elpa-stable packages by elpa-*.deb for more stable work
with =Debian=. So:



- first of all - configure packages in my session at the ~Dell~:
  - package has its ~.deb~ prototype:
    - install ~.deb~;
    - test it up:
  - package is unique at ~ELPA~ only:
    - move its folder to the ~site-lisp~ and recompile it there;



